type: dataset
title: "Weatheo climate data: city-level ERA5 temperature tables"
abstract: "City-level temperature tables (means, anomalies against 2011-2025, hot days, tropical nights, frost days, extremes) behind the Weatheo climate reports, derived from ERA5 via Open-Meteo."
